                                        <ul>
                                            <li>KC’s offense is far more methodical than explosive</li>
                                            <li>Dallas plays its best defense at home</li>
                                            <li>Both teams struggle in goal-to-go situations at times</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </td>
                                    <td>Dallas 27 – Kansas City 20</td>
                                    <td>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>🔥 Patrick Mahomes UNDER 282.5 passing yards</li>
                                            <li>🔥 CeeDee Lamb OVER 7.5 receptions</li>
                                            <li>🔥 Tony Pollard Anytime TD</li>
                                        </ul>
